;=============================================
;Vars
;=============================================
;var(0)  : Throw Tech
;var(1)  : Majin Vegeta palette check (config)
;var(2)  : Solid or transparent FX (config)
;var(3)  : Dash Elbow - Command variable (Ki Blast,Machine Gun Temper,etc.)
;var(4)  : Jump variable (from normal or super jump) - Ki Blast/BBA Charge Variable
;var(5)  : [MAJIN] M stands for... intro/Phone winpose variable
;var(6)  : a.HK no juggle check
;var(7)  : a.HK no juggle limiter
;var(8)  : KO Voice choice
;var(9)  : EX Rising Knee NumHits
;var(10) : Air dash limiter
;var(11) : opponent check (goku, vegeta)
;var(12) : alternate dashing elbow anim
;var(13) : Super BG choice (config)
;var(14) : Gethit gut or not (Ki Blast, Machine Gun Temper), plus used as a temp var in Majin Vegeta throws
;var(15) : Wolverine Flip follow up from dash elbow (value = strength) - Wolverine Sweep
;var(16) : Wolverine Flip follow up from dash elbow (backward or forward)
;var(17) : Zero Counter command
;var(18) : Juggle Safety
;var(19) : Gunfire count when firing
;var(20) : varset for 1st/2nd state of slashing chop
;var(21) : Gunfire smash count
;var(22) : Super jump var
;var(23) : Slashing Chop animelem set
;var(24) : slashing chop repel
;var(25) : varset for 1st/2nd state of charging Galactic Gunfire
;var(26) : Sonic intro voice randomizer/Aura Burst Pos X
;var(27) : First attack notification
;var(28) : Detect number enemies (for FF smoke)
;var(29) : Detect number enemies (for FF smoke)
;var(30) : Dash Collision count - Beam Collision count
;var(31) : Beam Collision Triggering
;var(32) : Dash Kick hitstun decay
;var(33) : 
;var(34) : 
;var(35) : [MAJIN] Big Bang's projectile life points
;var(36) : [MAJIN] Big Bang's projectile combo hit
;var(37) : s.SK > s.SK Chaining limiter
;var(38) : throw check
;var(39) : Age verification for intros (config)
;var(40) : s.SK > s.SK Chaining check
;var(41) : [MAJIN] Saiyan Pride Beatdown Animation previous
;var(42) : [MAJIN] Saiyan Pride Beatdown Animation random
;var(43) : [MAJIN] Super Move Checker in Sanity Mode (1:AB, 2:PB, 3:MGT, 4:RE, 5:BB)
;var(44) : Repel Projectile choice (config)
;var(45) : X axis Rage Gauge (config)
;var(46) : Y axis Rage Gauge (config)
;var(47) : flip knockout bounce
;var(48) :
;var(49) :
;var(50) : Remappal
;var(51) : Bulma Intro
;var(52) : -------------------------------- NO LONGER USED Challenge mode stuff
;var(53) : RAGE MODE - Buffer variable. 1000 and goes down
;var(54) : [MAJIN] Babidi/Bakuhatsu Winpose Flag ON/OFF
;var(55) : VOICE (Jap/Eng) variable
;var(56) : counter system notification
;var(57) : counter system notification
;var(58) : RAGE MODE - Flames variable. 0 to 3000 (Correction:2100)
;var(59) : RAGE MODE - Timer variable. 180 after ki attack, goes down
